# mtk/mt6781/drivers/input/conf: the MT6781's keys.
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_<NAME>=y in a defconfig builds a driver into the kernel (docs/drivers-config.md). MediaTek's drivers are
# `default n`: a configuration has them only when it includes mt6781.config.

driver MT6781_KEYS
	file    bsd/dev/hakios.mt6781_keys.c
	default n
	help    the realme 8i's power and volume keys (buttons=3): volume down on the keypad at 0x10010000, volume up and power
	help    on the MT6358 PMIC through its wrapper; reads only
